{"kind":"reasoning","id":"p1-561a626c","text":"The user asks for a new feature: VPN surfaces should detect profiles whose provisioned credential the server no longer accepts and offer a one-click refresh, so subscribers who never open Account are repaired.

This is a substantial feature. Let me first understand the codebase pieces:
- VPN surfaces: apps/web/src/features/vpn/* (OverviewSurface, CoreSurface, TunnelSurface, AetherSurface, ProviderSurface, DnsttSurface, VpnPage).
- Provisioned profiles: apps/web/src/lib/cloud/provisionProfiles.ts (importProvisionedConfigs), cloud worker netpulse-integration (provisioning), cloud worker vpn-config.ts (per-user credentials), reports about per-user credential rotation.
